      "author": "Shirish Garud",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": "Nostalgia of college days having late night tea and pastries with friends while coming back from movie on cycle. Same environment but it's different now crowded, pastries vanished!!!  Still tea and soft buns taste the same",
      "date": "2026-08-13T16:52:01.467Z",
